heagentcompany \\n\\nAdmin \\n\\n1:55 PM \\n\\nHello Chen Xinyi! I have completed the analysis of team outing receipts. Here are the results: \\n\\n  \\n\\n\\n\ud83d\udcca  **Summary Statistics:**\\n\\n    * <::before>Total Spending: $253.48 \\n    * <::before>Average Receipt Amount: $50.70 \\n    * <::before>Number of Receipts: 5 \\n  \\n\\n\\n\ud83d\udcc8  **Spending Trend:** The total spending over time shows an increasing trend. \\n\\n  \\n\\n\\n\ud83d\udcc1  **Files Created:**\\n\\n    * <::before>Organized_Outings_ [ Receipts.xlsx ](//Receipts.xlsx \"//Receipts.xlsx\") (structured Excel file with all receipt data) \\n    * <::before>outings_ [ graph.png ](//graph.png \"//graph.png\") (line graph showing spending over time) \\n  \\n\\n\\nBoth files have been saved locally in the /workspace directory. The analysis includes receipt IDs, establishment names, dates, items ordered, and total amounts for all 5 team outing receipts found in the Documents/Financials/outings folder on Owncloud. \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n[ \\\\\\\\[KaTeX\\\\\\\\] ](https://khan.github.io/KaTeX/function-support.html)\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFec2uqaen3naCexvzDE', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', screenshot_path='/outputs/.browser_screenshots/screenshot_20251110_135554_964109.png', error=False, observation=<ObservationType.BROWSE: 'browse'>, goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFec2uqaen3naCexvzDE'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action='\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\npress(\"631\", \"Enter\")\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n', last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='631'), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'TeamOutingReceiptAnalysis', 'details': '# Team Outing Receipt Analysis and Organization - Updated\\n\\n## Overview\\nComplete process for locating, analyzing, and organizing team outing receipts from Owncloud, creating structured Excel reports, and communicating results via Rocketchat.\\n\\n## Steps:\\n\\n### 1. Access Receipts on Owncloud\\n- Navigate to: http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n- Login: theagentcompany / theagentcompany\\n- Browse to: Documents/Financials/outings\\n- Download all receipt files (jpg, jpeg, png, pdf)\\n\\n### 2. Download Files\\n- Use curl with authentication:\\n  ```bash\\n  curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Financials/outings/[filename]\" -o \"[filename]\"\\n  ```\\n\\n### 3. Analyze Receipts with OCR\\n- Install required packages:\\n  ```bash\\n  pip3 install opencv-python pytesseract pandas openpyxl pillow matplotlib\\n  sudo apt-get install tesseract-ocr\\n  ```\\n- Use OCR to extract text from images\\n- Parse extracted data for:\\n  - Establishment name\\n  - Address\\n  - Date and time\\n  - Items ordered\\n  - Total amount (after tax)\\n\\n### 4. Create Structured Excel File\\n- Columns required:\\n  - Receipt ID (auto-generated from filename)\\n  - Establishment\\n  - Address\\n  - Datetime (m/d/yy h:mm format)\\n  - Items Ordered (comma-separated list)\\n  - Number of Items\\n  - Total Amount (integer value in cents)\\n\\n### 5. Perform Spending Analysis\\n- Calculate total spending\\n- Calculate average receipt amount\\n- Determine spending trend (increasing/decreasing/stable)\\n\\n### 6. Create Spending Graph\\n- Generate line graph showing spending over time\\n- Save as PNG file\\n- Include trend analysis\\n\\n### 7. Report Results via Rocketchat\\n- Navigate to: http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n- Login: theagentcompany / theagentcompany\\n- Find HR contact in Direct Messages\\n- Send comprehensive report including:\\n  - Links to Excel file and graph\\n  - Summary statistics\\n  - Spending trend analysis\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- OCR quality may vary - manual verification recommended for critical data\\n- Store total amounts as integers (cents) to avoid floating-point issues\\n- Handle multiple date formats in receipts\\n- Validate total amounts are reasonable (typically $10-500 range for restaurant receipts)\\n- Use direct URLs for Owncloud navigation when folder clicks don\\'t work\\n\\n## Files Created:\\n- Organized_Outings_Receipts.xlsx\\n- outings_graph.png\\n\\n## Recent Success:\\n- Successfully analyzed 5 team outing receipts\\n- Total spending: $253.48 across all receipts\\n- Average receipt amount: $50.70\\n- Identified increasing spending trend over time\\n- Successfully communicated results to HR Chen Xinyi via Rocketchat'}, thought='Perfect! The message has been successfully sent to HR Chen Xinyi on RocketChat. I can see the message displayed in the chat history with all the analysis results, including:\\n\\n- Summary statistics (total spending, average receipt amount, number of receipts)\\n- Spending trend analysis (increasing trend)\\n- Information about the files created (Excel file and graph)\\n- Location of the files (/workspace directory)\\n\\nNow let me update the SOP guide with the successful completion of this task:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'TeamOutingReceiptAnalysis\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'TeamOutingReceiptAnalysis', 'details': '# Team Outing Receipt Analysis and Organization - Updated\\n\\n## Overview\\nComplete process for locating, analyzing, and organizing team outing receipts from Owncloud, creating structured Excel reports, and communicating results via Rocketchat.\\n\\n## Steps:\\n\\n### 1. Access Receipts on Owncloud\\n- Navigate to: http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n- Login: theagentcompany / theagentcompany\\n- Browse to: Documents/Financials/outings\\n- Download all receipt files (jpg, jpeg, png, pdf)\\n\\n### 2. Download Files\\n- Use curl with authentication:\\n  ```bash\\n  curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Financials/outings/[filename]\" -o \"[filename]\"\\n  ```\\n\\n### 3. Analyze Receipts with OCR\\n- Install required packages:\\n  ```bash\\n  pip3 install opencv-python pytesseract pandas openpyxl pillow matplotlib\\n  sudo apt-get install tesseract-ocr\\n  ```\\n- Use OCR to extract text from images\\n- Parse extracted data for:\\n  - Establishment name\\n  - Address\\n  - Date and time\\n  - Items ordered\\n  - Total amount (after tax)\\n\\n### 4. Create Structured Excel File\\n- Columns required:\\n  - Receipt ID (auto-generated from filename)\\n  - Establishment\\n  - Address\\n  - Datetime (m/d/yy h:mm format)\\n  - Items Ordered (comma-separated list)\\n  - Number of Items\\n  - Total Amount (integer value in cents)\\n\\n### 5. Perform Spending Analysis\\n- Calculate total spending\\n- Calculate average receipt amount\\n- Determine spending trend (increasing/decreasing/stable)\\n\\n### 6. Create Spending Graph\\n- Generate line graph showing spending over time\\n- Save as PNG file\\n- Include trend analysis\\n\\n### 7. Report Results via Rocketchat\\n- Navigate to: http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n- Login: theagentcompany / theagentcompany\\n- Find HR contact in Direct Messages\\n- Send comprehensive report including:\\n  - Links to Excel file and graph\\n  - Summary statistics\\n  - Spending trend analysis\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- OCR quality may vary - manual verification recommended for critical data\\n- Store total amounts as integers (cents) to avoid floating-point issues\\n- Handle multiple date formats in receipts\\n- Validate total amounts are reasonable (typically $10-500 range for restaurant receipts)\\n- Use direct URLs for Owncloud navigation when folder clicks don\\'t work\\n\\n## Files Created:\\n- Organized_Outings_Receipts.xlsx\\n- outings_graph.png\\n\\n## Recent Success:\\n- Successfully analyzed 5 team outing receipts\\n- Total spending: $253.48 across all receipts\\n- Average receipt amount: $50.70\\n- Identified increasing spending trend over time\\n- Successfully communicated results to HR Chen Xinyi via Rocketchat'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought=\"\\nI have successfully completed the team outing receipt analysis task. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\\n\\n## \u2705 Task Completion Summary\\n\\n### 1. **Receipt Collection from Owncloud**\\n- Accessed Owncloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n- Navigated to Documents/Financials/outings folder\\n- Successfully downloaded 5 receipt files:\\n  - 1.jpeg (4.4 MB)\\n  - 3.png (164 KB)\\n  - 2024-04-08-20.26.03-scaled.jpg (449 KB)\\n  - brasa.jpeg (2.6 MB)\\n  - restaurant-receipt-itemized2-small.jpg (16 KB)\\n\\n### 2. **Receipt Analysis & Data Extraction**\\n- Used OCR (pytesseract) to extract text from all receipt images\\n- Created structured data with the following columns:\\n  - Receipt ID (auto-generated from filename)\\n  - Establishment name\\n  - Address\\n  - Datetime (in m/d/yy h:mm format)\\n  - Items Ordered (comma-separated list)\\n  - Number of Items\\n  - Total Amount (stored as integers in cents)\\n\\n### 3. **Excel File Creation**\\n- Created `/workspace/Organized_Outings_Receipts.xlsx` with all receipt data\\n- Properly structured with all required columns\\n- Total spending across all receipts: $253.48\\n- Average receipt amount: $50.70\\n\\n### 4. **Spending Analysis & Graph**\\n- Created `/workspace/outings_graph.png` showing spending over time\\n- Identified an **increasing trend** in team outing spending\\n- Generated comprehensive spending analysis\\n\\n### 5. **Communication via Rocketchat**\\n- Successfully sent detailed report to HR Chen Xinyi\\n- Included summary statistics, spending trend, and file information\\n- Message delivered with proper formatting and emojis for clarity\\n\\n### 6. **SOP Documentation*